---
import goaisatsuBg from '../assets/images/goaisatsu-bg.png';
---

<section class="section goaisatsu">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="title-wrapper">
      <h2 class="title">ご挨拶</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <div class="body">
        <p>鶴峯館へようこそ。</p>
        <p>私どもの宿は、深い渓谷と豊かな自然に抱かれた、小さな湯の宿でございます。</p>
        <p>代々受け継がれた手作りの郷土料理と、肌に優しい源泉のお湯、そして山里ならではの静けさをもちまして、皆さまをお待ち申し上げております。</p>
        <p>どうぞごゆるりと、寛ぎのひとときをお過ごしくださいませ。</p>
      </div>

      <p class="signature">鶴峯館</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss" define:vars={{ goaisatsuBgUrl: `url(${goaisatsuBg.src})` }}>
  @use '../styles/variables' as *;
  @use '../styles/mixins' as *;

  .goaisatsu {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    background-image: var(--goaisatsuBgUrl);
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: center;
    background-size: cover;

    &::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65); // 可読性確保のオーバーレイ
      z-index: -1;
    }
  }

  .title-wrapper {
    text-align: center;
  }

  // About.astro と同じ装飾線パターン
  .title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 30px;
    font-size: 2rem;

    @include tablet {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    &::before,
    &::after {
      content: '';
      display: block;
      max-width: 200px;
      width: 100%;
      height: 1px;
      background: #fff;

      @include tablet {
        max-width: 100px;
      }

      @include sp {
        width: 50px;
      }
    }
  }

  .content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row-reverse;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 3em;
    margin: 60px auto 0;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 32px;

    @include tablet {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
    }
  }

  .body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    max-height: 400px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    line-height: 3;
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;

    p {
      margin: 0;
      margin-block-start: 2em;  // 段落と段落の間（左方向の余白）

      &:first-child {
        margin-block-start: 0;
      }
    }

    @include tablet {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
       // SP では中央揃えだと折り返しが汚くなるので左揃え
    }
  }

  .signature {
    align-self: flex-end;
    margin-top: 48px;
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
  }
</style>